{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"43ae9327f3a9401b8ec950d5d27f64f048bbd7ac8d6d42e14967d229e27fd011","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["呼籲公義和憐憫"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["大流士王執政第四年九月，即基斯流月四日，耶和華的話傳給了撒迦利亞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那時，伯特利人差遣沙利色、利堅米勒及其隨從去向耶和華求恩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他們問萬軍之耶和華殿裡的祭司和先知：「我們還要照多年的慣例在五月哀傷、禁食嗎？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["萬軍之耶和華對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["「你要對境內的民眾和祭司說，『這七十年來，你們在五月和七月禁食、哀傷，難道真的是為了我嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你們吃喝，難道不是為自己吃、為自己喝嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["這些豈不是耶和華藉從前的先知所宣告的嗎？當時耶路撒冷和周圍的城邑人口興盛、繁榮，南地和丘陵都有人居住。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["耶和華又對撒迦利亞說："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「萬軍之耶和華曾對你們的祖先說，『要秉公行義，彼此以慈愛和憐憫相待。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["不可欺壓寡婦、孤兒、寄居者和窮人，不可設陰謀彼此相害。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他們卻不理會，頑梗地背過身去，充耳不聞，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["心如鐵石，不遵從律法，也不遵從萬軍之耶和華藉著祂的靈指示從前的先知所說的話。因此，萬軍之耶和華非常憤怒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["祂說，『我曾呼喚他們，他們不聽；將來他們呼求我，我也不聽。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我要用旋風把他們吹散到陌生的萬國中，使他們的土地荒涼、杳無人跡，因為他們使美好的土地一片荒涼。』」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}